{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2022-08-23 10:00:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN WATER CHARITABLE FOUNDATION AWARDS $1.5 MILLION THROUGH WATER AND ENVIRONMENT GRANT PROGRAM', 'text': 'CAMDEN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE AMERICAN WATER CHARITABLE FOUNDATION, A 501(C)(3) ORGANIZATION ESTABLISHED BY AMERICAN WATER, THE LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED U.S. WATER AND WASTEWATER UTILITY COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY IT AWARDED A COMBINED TOTAL OF $1.5 MILLION TO 36 ORGANIZATIONS IN 12 STATES, SUPPORTING COMMUNITIES SERVED BY AMERICAN WATER THROUGH THE 2022 WATER AND ENVIRONMENT GRANT PROGRAM. “THE AMERICAN WATER CHARITABLE FOUNDATION IS PLEASED TO PARTNER WITH ORGANIZATIONS ACROSS AMERICAN WATE'}